	(text "AMD Versal Premium XCVP1802. GTM must cover 16 RX plus 16 TX JESD204C lanes at 28.21 Gbit/s NRZ and 8 lanes at 112 Gbit/s PAM4 for two QSFP-DD cages. Package and speed grade come from the channel-loss report. VP1802 is the part used on the VPK180, so the lane count is not a guess; a smaller Premium is only substituted if its GTM table still covers this contract. The iCE40UP5K is not continued: 5280 LUT4 cannot absorb a JESD204C link, a DDC, or a packetizer. No LPC4330. The Versal PS (A72) runs the instrument; the FX20 is only the USB device port."
		(at 20.00 18.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)))
		(uuid "deb6e810-8cdd-55f5-b286-16e28ca41399")
	)
