	(text "LVDS_P/N0..15 and LVDS_CLK are the FX20 GPIF III receive bus: FPGA to host only, 1.25 Gbit/s per lane, 16 lanes. FX_D0..31 plus FX_CLK is the LVCMOS bus. FX20 transmits toward the FPGA at 80 MHz DDR on that bus, about 5 Gbit/s, which is the USB TX-sample ceiling. Wideband TX uses the QSFP-DD, not USB. QSFP_TX_Pn / QSFP_RX_Pn and QSFP2_TX_Pn / QSFP2_RX_Pn for n=0..3 are the two 400GbE ports, 112 Gbit/s PAM4."
		(at 20.00 320.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "d824d0ac-5d03-532e-b41a-0819fdc8ee6b")
	)
